.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CPP-API: Abstract interface for log stream implementations\&. 

Several default implementations are provided, see \fBaiDefaultLogStream\fP for more details\&. Writing your own implementation of \fBLogStream\fP is just necessary if these are not enough for your purpose\&. 
